# ULYS-218.4 — `RealExternalWorktreeImport` 桥接到 `worktree-service::scan_external_worktrees`

> 父 issue: [ULYS-158 Worktree 共享目录 3 机制](https://app.multica.ai/issue/01a0bf6f-3a37-7abc-bf52-c5283219091d)
> 兄弟 issue: [ULYS-218 (ULYS-158.5)](https://app.multica.ai/issue/01a0cdb8-dc9a-7a3e-bc39-2477a3ae9c7d) (backend scope 100% shipped in PR #107)
> Stage: 3 (worktree-service Stage 3 续作 per 2026-09-24 JST D-Boy "按照你推荐即可")
> spec: `docs/ecosystem-survey/orca-design-survey.md` v1.0 §3 FR-ORCA-011 AC-1 hidden default 真实数据面
> baseline: `origin/dev` SHA `8900fd30`

## 1. Scope

ULYS-218 (PR #107) 提供了 `RealExternalWorktreeImport` **trait + InMemory 实现** (in-process state-backed). 但**真实 git porcelain 数据面** (`worktree-service::scan_external_worktrees` per ULYS-195) 仍在另一个模块 — 两边**未桥接**. 本期让 trait 的 `Real` 实现走真实 `git worktree list --porcelain`, 让 AC-1 hidden default 端到端可用.

## 2. 拆解

### 2.1 新建 `RealExternalWorktreeImport` (替换 InMemory)

`crates/worktree-shared-dir/src/external_worktree_import.rs` 当前只有 `InMemoryExternalWorktreeImport`. 新增 `RealExternalWorktreeImport`:

```rust
pub struct RealExternalWorktreeImport {
    git_provider: Arc<dyn GitProvider>,
    state_machine: Arc<WorktreeStateMachine>,
}

impl ExternalWorktreeImport for RealExternalWorktreeImport {
    async fn scan(&self, repo_id: Uuid) -> SharedDirResult<Vec<ExternalWorktree>> {
        // 1. git_provider.worktree_list_porcelain(repo_id) → 调 worktree-service::scan_external_worktrees
        // 2. 把 porcelain v2 输出转 Vec<ExternalWorktree>
        // 3. 对 is_managed=false 的 hidden ones 标 hidden (per AC-1)
    }

    async fn import(&self, repo_id: Uuid, path: PathBuf) -> SharedDirResult<WorktreeId> {
        // 1. 调 RealWorktreeCreateAsync::start() (ULYS-217) → 走 Provisioning 状态机
        // 2. 返回 worktree_id
    }

    async fn cleanup_stale(&self, repo_id: Uuid) -> SharedDirResult<Vec<PathBuf>> {
        // 1. 重新 scan → 比对 state_machine 已知 path
        // 2. 对 git worktree list 不再列出的 path → 从 state_machine 移除 (per AC-3)
    }
}
```

### 2.2 trait 改 abstract

让 `ExternalWorktreeImport` trait 持有 `Real` 默认实现 (per workspace pattern, see `WorktreeCreateAsync` ULYS-158.4):

```rust
// crates/worktree-shared-dir/src/external_worktree_import.rs
#[async_trait]
pub trait ExternalWorktreeImport: Send + Sync {
    async fn scan(...) -> ...;
    async fn import(...) -> ...;
    async fn cleanup_stale(...) -> ...;
}

// crate-level type alias
pub type DynExternalWorktreeImport = Arc<dyn ExternalWorktreeImport + Send + Sync>;
```

DI 注册到 `crates/api/src/main.rs` + `crates/cli/src/main.rs`.

### 2.3 集成测试 (真实 git repo)

`crates/worktree-shared-dir/tests/test/real_external_worktree_integration.rs`:

```rust
#[tokio::test]
async fn real_scan_external_worktrees_returns_porcelain_v2() {
    // 1. 在 temp dir 建一个 git repo, worktree add 一个分支
    // 2. 调 RealExternalWorktreeImport::scan(repo_id)
    // 3. 期望: 返回 ExternalWorktree { path, head_commit, branch, is_managed=false }
}

#[tokio::test]
async fn real_cleanup_stale_removes_removed_worktree() {
    // 1. 同上 setup
    // 2. 调 scan → 1 个 entry
    // 3. git worktree remove (在 temp dir)
    // 4. 调 cleanup_stale → 返回那个 path
    // 5. 调 scan → 0 个 entry (per AC-3)
}
```

## 3. 实现路径

### 3.1 复用 ULYS-195 worktree-service 函数

`crates/worktree-service/src/service_impl.rs` (per PR #102 merged) 已有:

```rust
pub async fn scan_external_worktrees(repo_id: Uuid) -> ServiceResult<Vec<Worktree>>;
pub fn parse_porcelain(output: &str) -> ServiceResult<Vec<Worktree>>;
```

`RealExternalWorktreeImport::scan` 调这两个 → map `Worktree` → `ExternalWorktree` (新 DTO, 字段 `is_managed` 来自比对 `WorktreeStateMachine` 已知 managed list).

### 3.2 cleanup_stale 路径

```rust
async fn cleanup_stale(&self, repo_id: Uuid) -> SharedDirResult<Vec<PathBuf>> {
    let porcelain = self.git_provider.worktree_list_porcelain(repo_id).await?;
    let porcelain_paths: HashSet<PathBuf> = porcelain.iter().map(|w| w.path.clone()).collect();
    let known = self.state_machine.list_paths(repo_id).await?;
    let stale: Vec<PathBuf> = known.into_iter().filter(|p| !porcelain_paths.contains(p)).collect();
    for p in &stale {
        self.state_machine.remove_path(repo_id, p.clone()).await?;
    }
    Ok(stale)
}
```

