## 8. 与 §B 映射表一致性

- FR-ORCA-011 AC-1 (hidden default): `RealExternalWorktreeImport::scan` 真实 git porcelain → ExternalWorktree.is_managed=false 标 hidden
- FR-ORCA-011 AC-2 (import 进入 Provisioning): `import` 调 `RealWorktreeCreateAsync::start()` (ULYS-217)
- FR-ORCA-011 AC-3 (cleanup after remove): `cleanup_stale` 比对 porcelain vs state_machine, 移除 stale

## 9. 启动条件

**依赖 PR #107 backend scope merged** ✅ + ULYS-195 `scan_external_worktrees` 已 ship ✅. 可立即启动.

